description: Next.js App Router conventions for this project.
globs:
  - "app/**/*"
  - "src/app/**/*"
  - "components/**/*"
  - "src/components/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Next.js

- Follow the installed Next.js version.
- Prefer Server Components; add "use client" only when interactivity or a browser API is required.
- Keep secrets and privileged checks on the server.
- Validate untrusted input on the server.
- Use TanStack Query only where client-side server state is already the project pattern.
